        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sergio Marchionne\n- Companies: Fiat Industrial S.p.A., Fiat Chrysler Automobiles N.V., Bugatti, Volkswagen Group\n- Events: Ascari competition, Fiat merger\n- Products: Bugatti Veyron, Supercar Challenge\n\nFacts:\n- Supercar Challenge features the Bugatti Veyron, a car made by Bugatti.\n- Bugatti is a car brand within the Volkswagen Group.\n- Sergio Marchionne was one of the judges for an Ascari competition.\n- Sergio Marchionne was the chairman of Fiat Industrial S.p.A..\n- Fiat Industrial S.p.A. merged into Fiat Chrysler Automobiles N.V., a new holding company based in the Netherlands.",
